## 3. Number Badge — 3 Variants (cho game có heatmap)

Áp dụng cho: **Mega645, Power655, Lotto535, Keno**. Không áp dụng cho Max3D/Max3DPro/Bingo18.

| Variant | Zone | Style | Mục đích |
|---------|------|-------|----------|
| `filled` (default) | Heatmap grid | Nền đậm + heatLevel intensity | Primary focus |
| `soft` | TopCombos, LiveFeed | Nền nhạt + chữ đậm | Supporting info |
| `outlined` | Dự phòng | Viền mỏng, nền trong | Nhẹ nhất (chưa dùng) |

### Implementation

```tsx
export type NumberBadgeVariant = "filled" | "outlined" | "soft";

export function NumberBadge({ num, muted, variant = "filled", heatLevel }) {
  let colorClass: string;
  if (muted) {
    colorClass = "bg-muted/40 text-muted-foreground";
  } else if (variant === "soft") {
    colorClass = "bg-{game}-100 text-{game}-700 dark:bg-{game}-900/40 dark:text-{game}-300";
  } else if (variant === "outlined") {
    colorClass = "border border-{game}-400/70 text-{game}-600 bg-transparent ...";
  } else {
    colorClass = heatLevel ? HEAT_BADGE_STYLES[heatLevel] : "bg-{game}-600 text-white";
  }
  return (
    <span className={cn(
      "inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full font-bold tabular-nums leading-none shrink-0",
      HEATMAP_BADGE_SIZE, HEATMAP_BADGE_TEXT, colorClass,
    )}>{num}</span>
  );
}
```

**Quy tắc:**

- Size: luôn dùng **shared token** `HEATMAP_BADGE_SIZE` (`size-6` = 24px).
- Text: luôn dùng **shared token** `HEATMAP_BADGE_TEXT` (`text-[11px]`).
- TopCombos + LiveFeed: **luôn `variant="soft"`** — KHÔNG dùng `filled`.

