## 4. Heatmap Intensity Scale — 5 Levels (cho game có heatmap)

```typescript
type HeatLevel = "cold" | "low" | "mid" | "warm" | "hot";

function getHeatLevel(count: number, maxCount: number): HeatLevel {
  if (count === 0 || maxCount === 0) return "cold";
  const ratio = count / maxCount;
  if (ratio >= 0.8)  return "hot";
  if (ratio >= 0.55) return "warm";
  if (ratio >= 0.3)  return "mid";
  if (ratio >= 0.1)  return "low";
  return "cold";
}
```

- Badge: gradient từ `{game}-300` (cold) → `{game}-700` (warm) → `amber-500` (hot).
- Hot level: **amber cross-game** + `ring-2 ring-amber-300/50`.
- Cell background: subtle tinting cho mid/warm/hot.

### Shared design tokens

**Source:** `src/components/games/shared/game-number-tokens.ts`

```typescript
export const HEATMAP_BADGE_SIZE = "size-6";         // 24px — đồng nhất tất cả game
export const HEATMAP_BADGE_TEXT = "text-[11px]";     // T4 font tier
export const HEATMAP_CELL_PT = "pt-8";               // padding-top cho badge absolute
export const HEATMAP_CELL_DATA_SIZE = "text-[11px]"; // T4 — amount trong cell
export const HEATMAP_CELL_SUB_SIZE = "text-[10px]";  // T5 — count/multiplier
```

**BẮT BUỘC dùng tokens** cho tất cả game có heatmap. KHÔNG hardcode size.

### Grid dimensions per game

| Game | Pool | Cols | Rows | Has Special Grid |
|------|------|------|------|:----------------:|
| Lotto 5/35 | 35+12 | 7+4 | 5+3 | ✅ (ĐB 01–12) |
| Mega 6/45 | 45 | 9 | 5 | — |
| Power 6/55 | 55 | 11 | 5 | — (bonus riêng) |
| Keno | 80 | 10 | 8 | — |

Badge size cố định `size-6` — game nhiều số thì nhiều hàng, KHÔNG thu nhỏ badge.

