## 5. NumbersWithTooltip — Collapse Long Lists

Dùng cho **TopCombos** và **LiveFeed**. Khi entry có > 7 số, collapse vào `+N` tooltip.

```typescript
const NUMBERS_VISIBLE_LIMIT = 7;
```

```tsx
<div className="flex items-center gap-1 flex-nowrap overflow-hidden">
  {visible.map((n) => <NumberBadge key={n} num={n} variant="soft" />)}
  {needsCollapse && (
    <TooltipProvider delayDuration={100}>
      <Tooltip>
        <TooltipTrigger asChild>
          <span className="... text-xs ... px-1.5 h-6 ...">+{hidden.length}</span>
        </TooltipTrigger>
        <TooltipContent>
          <p className="text-xs text-muted-foreground mb-1.5">Tất cả {numbers.length} số</p>
          <div className="flex items-center gap-1 flex-wrap max-w-[200px]">
            {numbers.map((n) => <NumberBadge key={n} num={n} variant="soft" />)}
          </div>
        </TooltipContent>
      </Tooltip>
    </TooltipProvider>
  )}
</div>
```

**Quy tắc:** `flex-nowrap overflow-hidden`, `+N` badge cùng `h-6` với NumberBadge, tooltip full list wrapped.

