## 6. Top Combos

Top 3 bộ số phổ biến nhất, nằm dưới heatmap grid trong cùng Card.

```tsx
<div className="flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-lg border border-border/40 bg-muted/10 px-3 py-2">
  <span className="text-sm leading-none shrink-0">{medal}</span>       {/* 🥇🥈🥉 */}
  <div className="flex-1 min-w-0 overflow-hidden">
    <NumbersWithTooltip numbers={c.numbers} variant="soft" />
    <p className="text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1">{playTypeLabel}</p>
  </div>
  <div className="text-right shrink-0">
    <p className="text-xs font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground">{entryCount} vé</p>
    <p className="text-xs tabular-nums text-muted-foreground">{formatNumber(totalAmount)}</p>
  </div>
</div>
```

- Badge: `variant="soft"`, dùng `NumbersWithTooltip`.
- Medal: `["🥇", "🥈", "🥉"]`, rank > 3 dùng `#N`.
- Tất cả text ngoài badge: `text-xs` minimum.

