## 7. Live Feed

Danh sách entries cược gần nhất. Nằm bên phải heatmap (30% width). Pattern **đồng nhất mọi game**.

### Entry structure — 3-row grid

```
Row 1: [color dot] PlayType label                    (empty)
Row 2: NumberBadges (soft) + suffix          Amount (right-aligned)
Row 3: Username · Tenant                     Timestamp (right-aligned)
```

### Key design decisions

1. **Left border by play type**: `border-l-2` + `style={{ borderLeftColor: color?.fill }}`.
2. **Entry mới nhất**: `bg-muted/20` subtle highlight.
3. **Number badges**: `variant="soft"` + `NumbersWithTooltip` — collapse > 7, `flex-nowrap`.
4. **Live indicator**: chấm pulse + "Live" khi draw đang mở bán.
5. **Scroll**: `overflow-y-auto` + `maxHeight: 950`.

### Adaptation per game type

| Game type | Row 2 content |
|-----------|---------------|
| Number-pool (Mega, Power, Lotto, Keno) | `NumbersWithTooltip` + suffix (bao type) |
| Triplet (Max3D, Max3DPro) | Triplet badges (000–999) + playMode label |
| Dice (Bingo18) | Dice display + bet type label |

### Font sizes — tất cả `text-xs` (12px)

| Element | Class |
|---------|-------|
| PlayType label | `text-xs font-semibold` + play type color |
| Number suffix | `text-xs text-muted-foreground` |
| Amount | `text-xs font-semibold tabular-nums text-foreground` |
| Username · Tenant | `text-xs text-muted-foreground` |
| Timestamp | `text-xs font-mono tabular-nums text-muted-foreground` |
| Live indicator | `text-xs text-{game}-500 font-medium` |

