### PLAY_TYPE_COLORS

Mỗi game định nghĩa `PLAY_TYPE_COLORS: Record<string, { dot, text, fill, bg, border }>` trong `analytics-panels.tsx`. Reuse cho cả PlayTypeCard lẫn LiveFeed border-left.

Grid: `grid grid-cols-3 gap-3`. Sort by lines descending, filter `lines === 0`.

