| `DrawResult` | Kết quả + tiers | ✅ |
| `DrawFinancialDisplay` | Tài chính kỳ | ✅ (fields khác nhau) |

### DrawFinancialDisplay — 2 variants

```typescript
// Game CÓ Jackpot (mega645, power655, lotto535)
interface DrawFinancialDisplay {
  totalRevenue: number;
  totalFixedPrizes: number;
  totalAgentCommission: number;
  companyTake: number;           // ← chỉ game có Jackpot
  jackpotContribution: number;   // ← chỉ game có Jackpot
  jackpotBefore: number;         // ← chỉ game có Jackpot
  jackpotAfter: number;          // ← chỉ game có Jackpot
}

// Game KHÔNG có Jackpot (keno, max3d, max3dpro, bingo18)
interface DrawFinancialDisplay {
  totalRevenue: number;
  totalFixedPrizes: number;
  totalAgentCommission: number;
  profit: number;                // = revenue - prizes - commission
}
```

